  "operative_text": "Section 1 (SDCL 22-14-11): The provisions of § 22-14-9 do not apply to any person who possesses a pistol or revolver (1) In the person's dwelling or place of business (2) On land owned or rented by that person or by a member of that person's household; or (3) While driving or within ten feet of that person's motorcycle.\nSection 1 (SDCL 22-14-11): The provisions of this section do not allow a person to possess a firearm if that person is otherwise prohibited from the possession of a firearm under state or federal law."
